@bank all
// Head writer W (playtest 1, 0.63.2; seat T's tap-to-join, read as LINES['join.<id>.<what>'][k].text). TEXTS.
// join.<id>.tip: the tip and the arrow's label (short; {name} = the leader's first name).
// join.<id>.notice: the toast when you join: what it is, what you do, what it gives.
// Walks only: join.<id>.done (the walk finished) and join.<id>.left (you dropped out).

== join.running.tip
- Tap {name} to join Gym club
== join.running.notice
- Gym club: pick a machine and work out with everyone. Fitness and social up. Soup after.

== join.department-cup.tip
- Tap {name} to join the cup
== join.department-cup.notice
- Department cup: play for Works against the other departments. Social and leisure up.

== join.lap-of-the-wren.tip
- Tap {name} to join the lap
== join.lap-of-the-wren.notice
- Lap of the Wren: walk the promenade together, in one line, chatting. Social and leisure up.
== join.lap-of-the-wren.done
- One lap of the Wren. Lovely walk.
== join.lap-of-the-wren.left
- You've stepped out of the lap. They'll go round without you.

== join.lantern-walk.tip
- Tap {name} to join the lantern walk
== join.lantern-walk.notice
- Lantern walk: carry a lantern round the ship with everyone. Social and leisure up.
== join.lantern-walk.done
- The lanterns are home. What a sight.
== join.lantern-walk.left
- You've left the lantern walk. The lights carry on without you.

== join.sunrise-stretch.tip
- Tap {name} to join the stretch
== join.sunrise-stretch.notice
- Sunrise stretch: a gentle stretch in the garden before breakfast. Fitness and leisure up.

== join.cook-along.tip
- Tap {name} to join the cook-along
== join.cook-along.notice
- Cook-along: learn one simple dish in the galley, then eat your portion. Food and leisure up.

== join.garden-hour.tip
- Tap {name} to join garden hour
== join.garden-hour.notice
- Garden hour: tend the beds with the gardeners. Leisure and social up.

== join.pick-your-own.tip
- Tap {name} to pick fruit
== join.pick-your-own.notice
- Pick-your-own: fill a basket from the racks and take it to breakfast. Food and leisure up.

== join.sowing.tip
- Tap {name} to help with the sowing
== join.sowing.notice
- Sowing: plant the new season's seeds with everyone. Leisure and social up.

== join.harvest.tip
- Tap {name} to help with the harvest
== join.harvest.notice
- Harvest morning: pick the ripe crops with the garden crew. Leisure and social up.

== join.tiles-night.tip
- Tap {name} to join Tiles night
== join.tiles-night.notice
- Tiles night: sit at a board and play a few friendly games. Leisure and social up.

== join.tiles-ladder.tip
- Tap {name} to join the Tiles ladder
== join.tiles-ladder.notice
- Tiles ladder: play a round against everyone. The winner goes on the chalkboard. Leisure and social up.

== join.quiz.tip
- Tap {name} to join the quiz
== join.quiz.notice
- Quiz night: three questions about the ship. Nobody fails. Leisure and social up.

== join.jam.tip
- Tap {name} to join the jam
== join.jam.notice
- Music jam: sing along, clap along, or just listen. Leisure and social up.

== join.book-circle.tip
- Tap {name} to join the book circle
== join.book-circle.notice
- Book circle: sit with the circle and talk about this month's book. Leisure and social up.

== join.knit-and-natter.tip
- Tap {name} to join the circle
== join.knit-and-natter.notice
- Knit and natter: sit with the circle and do any hobby. Leisure and social up.

== join.postcard-night.tip
- Tap {name} to write a postcard
== join.postcard-night.notice
- Postcard night: write a card home. It goes out with the next mail run. Leisure and social up.

== join.observatory-night.tip
- Tap {name} to join observatory night
== join.observatory-night.notice
- Observatory night: lie back and look at the stars with everyone. Leisure and social up.

== join.open-lab.tip
- Tap {name} to join the open lab
== join.open-lab.notice
- Open lab: the Survey team show you what they're working on. Leisure and social up.

== join.works-tea.tip
- Tap {name} to join Friday tea
== join.works-tea.notice
- Works Friday tea: tea, biscuits and the week's news with Works. Social up, and a little food.

// Name on the beam (you, on arrival)
== join.name-on-the-beam.tip
- Tap the beam to paint your name
== join.name-on-the-beam.tell
- Go on, tap the beam. Your name goes up there.
== join.name-on-the-beam.paint
- Zeke hands you the pen. You paint your first name on the beam, beside everyone who's served in Works.
== join.name-on-the-beam.notice
- Your name is on the beam. The whole bay cheers. Welcome to Works.
// SW2 (0.92.3 item 13, DV1's key): Zeke explains the beam before you paint, one bubble each, in order (under 80
// characters, no placeholders). The last one hands over to you: the tap opens right after it.
== join.name-on-the-beam.explain
- Right. This is the beam. Every name on it has worked this bay.
- First day in Works, your first name goes up there. Every one of us did it.
- See the Chief's? Tiny letters, dead straight. Mine's the one that's far too big.
- Go on, then. Your turn. Right on the end, next to the rest of us.

// SW1 (2026-10-24, patch 0.92.5): the weekend traditions (WEEKEND_ON)
== join.saturday-run.tip
- Tap {name} to join the run
== join.saturday-run.notice
- Saturday run: three easy laps of the promenade before breakfast, any speed. Fitness and social up.
== join.saturday-run.done
- Three laps done. Breakfast has never looked better.
== join.saturday-run.left
- You've dropped out of the run. They'll finish the laps without you.

== join.every-song.tip
- Tap {name} to join Every song
== join.every-song.notice
- Every song: sing through the record cabinet in the music room, whatever the words are. Leisure and social up.

== join.night-owls-cocoa.tip
- Tap {name} for a late cocoa
== join.night-owls-cocoa.notice
- Night owls' cocoa: a mug and the stars in the bow lounge, lamps low. Social up, but staying up costs a little energy.

== join.gerald-clinic.tip
- Tap {name} to join the Gerald clinic
== join.gerald-clinic.notice
- Gerald clinic: bring a cactus to Cruz for a look, or take a new one home. Leisure and social up.

== join.sunday-story.tip
- Tap {name} to listen
== join.sunday-story.notice
- The Sunday story: Chief Holt reads one chapter in the common room, lights low. Leisure and social up.

== join.garden-picnic.tip
- Tap {name} to join the picnic
== join.garden-picnic.notice
- Garden picnic: take a parcel from the servery and eat it under the big tree. Food and social up.

== join.bread-day.tip
- Tap {name} to knead a loaf
== join.bread-day.notice
- Bread day: knead a loaf at the galley island for Monday's breakfast. Leisure and social up.

== join.big-jigsaw.tip
- Tap {name} to join the jigsaw
== join.big-jigsaw.notice
- The big jigsaw: add pieces to the Wren at the long table on Deck 1. Counts as your puzzles hobby. Leisure and social up.

// SW2, 0.92.6 item 5: One week aboard (Zeke's sit-down, Day 7).
== join.one-week-aboard.tip
- Tap {name} to sit down for tea
== join.one-week-aboard.notice
- One week aboard: tea with Zeke in the bow lounge, going over your first week. Social up.

// SW2, 0.92.6 item 2: the Sunday swap meet (host Orla Ishikawa).
== join.market.tip
- Tap {name} to join the swap meet
== join.market.notice
- Sunday swap meet: browse the stalls on the promenade and swap one thing for another. Social and leisure up.

// SW2, 0.92.6 item 4: Reading corner (host Esme Walsh).
== join.reading-corner.tip
- Tap {name} to join the reading corner
== join.reading-corner.notice
- Reading corner: sit close in the bow lounge with a book and talk about what you're reading. Leisure and social up.

== join.storm-stories.tip
- Tap {name} for storm stories by torchlight
== join.storm-stories.notice
- Come in, sit anywhere. Torch under your chin when it's your turn. Storm stories by torchlight: social and leisure up.
- Ah, good. We were just getting to the frightening part. It isn't very. Storm stories by torchlight: social and leisure up.
- Sit with us. Listen first. Tell yours if you want to. Nobody has to. Storm stories by torchlight: social and leisure up.

== join.farewell.tip
- Tap Saruth to see the Veyli off
== join.farewell.notice
- The Veyli farewell: stand with Envoy Saruth in the shuttle bay and see the delegation off. Social and leisure up.

== join.vesselLights.tip
- Tap Saruth to watch the little ship from the glass
